Package: power4
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jim Studt <jim@studt.net>
Depends: libc6, libedit2
Provides: power4ctl
Conflicts: power4ctl
Replaces: power4ctl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Host tools for power4 controllers
 Installs power4ctl, the serial and authenticated TCP management client, and
 power4d, the Swift UDP monitor for ESP-NOW gateway envelopes. The existing
 power4ctl systemd service keeps JSON state reports current for local consumers.
